# =====================================================================================
# Public informational site (C134) — www.mageride.lk
#
# **This file is deliberately empty, and that is the point.**
#
# MCS-34 describes this surface by four negatives, and the load-bearing one is the
# fourth: it has **no API dependency at request time**. There is no gateway origin to
# configure, no map style URL, no store URL read from the environment and no feature
# flag — the site renders, in all three languages, with the entire MageRide platform
# down. A variable here would be the first thing to make that untrue.
#
# If a variable is ever genuinely needed, it is **read on the server and is never
# `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.** Not one exists on this surface and none may be added:
# `scripts/check-bundle.mjs` fails the build if the prefix appears in any emitted
# client chunk at all, which is a stronger statement than the one `web-passenger`
# makes (that surface names its four server-only variables and checks for those).
# The stronger statement is the true one here, because there is nothing to leak.
#
# Content that looks like configuration is a **resource key**, not a variable —
# the two app-store URLs (D3: not live yet) and the contact address (D4: not chosen
# yet) are placeholder keys in `src/i18n/messages/`, so they are translated,
# type-checked and visible in review rather than injected at deploy time.
#
# The container therefore takes PORT (3004) and nothing else; see
# `infra/docker/Dockerfile.portal`.
# =====================================================================================
